/Author (Hunter Hughes)
/CreationDate (D\07220261111233308\05505\04700\047)
/Creator (H Heuristics PDF pipeline)
/Keywords (century pathways\054 paradoxical outlook optimization\054 positive development dynamics\054 positive pathways\054 sustainable convergence\054 polycrisis resilience\054 human exposure\054 exposure momentum\054 six capitals\054 conversion chains\054 multi\055dividend investments\054 proven pace\054 Global South\054 research influence)
/ModDate (D\07220261111233308\05505\04700\047)
/Producer (ReportLab PDF Library \055 www\056reportlab\056com)
/Subject (The twenty\055first century may grow more dangerous while humanity grows safer\056 This report is built on that paradox\072 climate\054 pollution\054 geopolitical and economic hazards may intensify\054 yet human outcomes can still improve if exposure and vulnerability decline faster than risks grow\056 It introduces Century Pathways\054 a research and influence programme of H Heuristics on the positive development loops that can reduce human exposure to polycrisis over the course of the century\054 guided by a principle it calls Paradoxical Outlook Optimization\072 the deliberate effort to improve long\055term human outcomes despite a worsening hazard baseline through early investment in compounding development pathways\056 It builds on the Positive Pathways framework \050HH\0552026\05560\051 and on Sustainable Convergence and Polycrisis Resilience\054 which it describes as concepts developed by Hunter Hughes\054 Founder of H Heuristics\056)
/Title (Century Pathways\072 Paradoxical Outlook Optimization\072 How Positive Development Loops Can Improve Humanity\047s Outlook in a Worsening Century)
/Trapped /False
>>
